    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_trade_01_00",
      "hash64": "A737742B537B6471",
      "text": "和你聊天以后，\\n总感觉变得有点伤感。[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_trade_01_01",
      "hash64": "A737732B537B62BE",
      "text": "你得负起责任来啊。[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_trade_01_02",
      "hash64": "A737722B537B610B",
      "text": "嗯……\\n那你就来陪我交换宝可梦吧。[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_trade_01_03",
      "hash64": "A737712B537B5F58",
      "text": "你的态度不错嘛。\\n我要用斯魔茶来交换，\\r\\n你要用什么？[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_trade_01_04",
      "hash64": "A737782B537B6B3D",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0101(0001)]啊……\\n以你来说算是不错的宝可梦呢。\\c\\n我会好好珍惜它的，\\n你不用担心啦！[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_trade_02_00",
      "hash64": "5529B2470ECBDCFE",
      "text": "要用你的[VAR 0x0101(0001)]\\n和我的斯魔茶交换对吧？[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_trade_02_01",
      "hash64": "5529B3470ECBDEB1",
      "text": "无法使用初训家不是自己的\\n宝可梦进行交换。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_trade_02_02",
      "hash64": "5529B0470ECBD998",
      "text": "无法使用稀有宝可梦\\n进行交换。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_trade_02_03",
      "hash64": "5529B1470ECBDB4B",
      "text": "无法使用异色宝可梦\\n进行交换。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_trade_03_00",
      "hash64": "7FA8283BC563F5CF",
      "text": "只有１只同行宝可梦的话，\\n是没法交换的，你不知道吗？\\c\\n等你有２只以上同行宝可梦时\\n再来找我吧。[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_trade_03_01",
      "hash64": "7FA8273BC563F41C",
      "text": "真是的……为什么啊！！[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_trade_04_00",
      "hash64": "4E02B6120C2A4164",
      "text": "果然你还是想\\n和我交换宝可梦的，对吧？[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_talkto_00",
      "hash64": "2C4FB0B2F93B1B18",
      "text": "你好像很闲啊。\\n我来陪你打一场吧？[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_cancel_00",
      "hash64": "983F442640B992F3",
      "text": "居然拒绝我的邀请，\\n你就不怕后悔一辈子吗？[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_battlestart_00",
      "hash64": "B438BE8BF69A5D4B",
      "text": "嘻嘻……那就让我\\n来锻炼你一下吧！[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_battlestart_01",
      "hash64": "B438BD8BF69A5B98",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]！\\n你怎么只有１只宝可梦啊？\\r\\n我想打双打对战啦。[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_battleend_win_00_00",
      "hash64": "E888E2879ECFADB0",
      "text": "……要是那个招式命中了，\\n我想赢的就是我了。[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_battleend_win_00_01",
      "hash64": "E888E3879ECFAF63",
      "text": "能让我一败涂地的人\\n也就只有你了。[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_battleend_win_00_02",
      "hash64": "E888E4879ECFB116",
      "text": "啊！稍微等一下！\\n作为奖励，我把那个给你吧！[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_battleend_win_00_03",
      "hash64": "E888E5879ECFB2C9",
      "text": "这个眼镜和你很配哦。\\n今后你就一辈子都戴着它吧。[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_reward_00",
      "hash64": "49C75872B5E6B284",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]从丹瑜那里\\n获得了[VAR 0xFF00(0008)]搞怪眼镜（来悲粗茶）[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_battleend_win_01_00",
      "hash64": "11C0F87C545260C1",
      "text": "……你听好了啊。\\n是我故意让你赢的，懂吗？[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_battleend_win_01_01",
      "hash64": "11C0F77C54525F0E",
      "text": "下次我可不会这样了！\\n明白了吧！真是的！[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_battleend_lose_00_00",
      "hash64": "868368BFB727D6F3",
      "text": "嘻嘻！这就是\\n我使出全力的结果。\\c\\n蓝莓联盟冠军的宝座\\n随时都可以让给我哦。[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_randomtalk_00",
      "hash64": "CE57B502C1301F12",
      "text": "你问为什么我\\n不像阿栗一样有口音？\\c\\n因为我是一位俏佳人！\\n就这么简单。[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 63,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_randomtalk_01",
      "hash64": "CE57B602C13020C5",
      "text": "学园和联盟社你都自然地\\n融入进去了，真可怕！\\r\\n感觉你挺适合去当间谍的？[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 64,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_randomtalk_02",
      "hash64": "CE57B302C1301BAC",
      "text": "厄诡椪它过得还好吗？\\c\\n组成夺回面具小队去打倒\\n宝伴们的日子真让人怀念啊。[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 65,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_randomtalk_03",
      "hash64": "CE57B402C1301D5F",
      "text": "你的[VAR 0x0101(0001)]很听话哦。\\n我甚至都想叫你向它学习呢！[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 66,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_randomtalk_04",
      "hash64": "CE57B102C1301846",
      "text": "我的斯魔茶很不错吧？\\c\\n它可是随时都能为你\\n送上热腾腾的茶水呢。[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
